<mxCell id="p4b19" value="OS 튜닝 (RHEL 10)&lt;br&gt;· fib_multipath_hash_policy=1, fib_multipath_use_neigh=1&lt;br&gt;· rp_filter=0 (ECMP 비대칭 경로), 루프백 /32 = 노드 IP&lt;br&gt;· tcp 버퍼 상향, BBR + fq, MTU 9000&lt;br&gt;· ring 버퍼 최대, 큐 수 = NUMA 로컬 코어, LRO off&lt;br&gt;· tuned network-throughput, firewalld 중지&lt;br&gt;효과 : leaf 1대 장애 = 세션 1개만 끊김. 쌍 동시 작업 불필요" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#222222;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="730" y="592" width="620" height="196" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
